---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base
  title="Privacy policy — Covenant"
  description="What data the Covenant website collects and how it is used."
>
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-16 md:py-24">
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Privacy policy</h1>
    <div class="prose-covenant mt-12">
      <p>
        This policy covers the Covenant website (covenant.uno). The Covenant
        desktop app is a separate thing: it runs on your machine and sends
        nothing to us.
      </p>

      <h2>Analytics</h2>
      <p>
        If you accept analytics cookies, we use
        <a href="https://clarity.microsoft.com">Microsoft Clarity</a> to
        understand how the site is used — pages visited, clicks, scrolling.
        Clarity sets cookies (<code>_clck</code>, <code>_clsk</code>) and
        processes usage data under
        <a href="https://www.microsoft.com/privacy/privacystatement">Microsoft's privacy statement</a>.
        We do not use this data for advertising, and we do not sell it.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you decline, no analytics run and no tracking cookies are set. Your
        choice is stored in your browser's local storage; clear it to be asked
        again.
      </p>

      <h2>What we don't collect</h2>
      <p>
        The site has no accounts, no forms, and no ads. We don't collect names,
        emails, or anything that identifies you personally.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions? Open an issue at
        <a href="https://github.com/karluiz/covenant">github.com/karluiz/covenant</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Base>

<style is:global>
  .prose-covenant { line-height: 1.7; }
  .prose-covenant > * + * { margin-top: 1.25rem; }
  .prose-covenant p { max-width: 68ch; color: rgb(232 239 230 / 0.8); }
  .prose-covenant h2 {
    margin-top: 3rem; font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: theme(colors.mist);
  }
  .prose-covenant a { color: theme(colors.moss.400); text-decoration: underline; }
  .prose-covenant code {
    font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 0.875em;
    background: rgb(232 239 230 / 0.08); padding: 0.1em 0.35em; border-radius: 4px;
  }
</style>
